graph TD
    A([User Visits Website]) --> B{Is Authenticated?}
    B -- No --> C[Login / Register Page]
    C --> D(Authenticate via Database)
    D --> E[User Dashboard]
    B -- Yes --> E
    
    E --> F[Create or Select Project]
    F --> G[Initialize Cloud IDE Workspace]
    G --> H([Main Editor UI Loads])
    
    H --> I[File Management]
    H --> J[Real-Time Collaboration]
    H --> K[Version Control / Git]
    
    I --> L(Save changes to Virtual File System)
    J --> M(Broadcast keystrokes to other users via WebSockets)
    K --> N(Commit changes to Server via Git CLI)
    
    L --> O([Cloud Storage Server])
    M --> O
    N --> O
    
    style A fill:#4caf50,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style B fill:#ff9800,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style H fill:#2196f3,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style O fill:#607d8b,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
